      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "We've already improved this a bit in the IK 2.0 update by making it so that if you are in full body, you can lean over things as long as you keep your hip tracker outside. This is as far as we're going to go, because freezing when you go through a wall is an intentional design.",
