  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-11-07T09:30:15.552Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the old IKTweaks mod, it was possible to bend over counters without getting your body frozen and do cool tricks with certains avatars, like walking into a portal placed on a wall (aka walking into and inside a wall if your playspace allowed for it) and popping out someplace else within that wall. This allowed re-enacting the Harry Potter train station scene, Portal schenanigans and much more, and I simply want this function back to be able to say there is nothing else missing from the experience before EAC.",
